- GOOD TO SEE YOU.

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:12.278
HEY, I'M GLAD I RAN INTO YOU.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.614
WHAT IS THAT JOKE THAT YOU
TOLD RECENTLY AT THE OFFICE?

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.882
