00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.285
- OH, GOSH.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.620
OKAY.
UM...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.988
ALL RIGHT, IT GOES LIKE THIS.
- YEAH.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.356
- SO, THERE'S THIS WOMAN, AND--

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:28.128
- [laughs]

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.896
- OKAY.
- [chuckles] I'M SORRY!

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.096
- GOOD AUDIENCE.

00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:33.299
- YEAH, I'M SORRY.
I LOVE IT ALREADY.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.401
I LOVE IT ALREADY.
[laughing]

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:36.836
- AWESOME.
OKAY.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.438
WELL, THIS SHOULD GO WELL.
UM...

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:43.609
SO THERE'S--THERE'S A WOMAN,
AND SHE GOES TO HER DOCTOR.

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:47.179
- SHE GOES TO HER DOCTOR!
IT'S ALREADY FUNNY.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.881
[laughing]
IT'S ALREADY FUNNY.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:50.850
- NO, I HAVEN'T EVEN GOTTEN
TO THE SETUP YET.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.886
- [laughing]

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:56.856
- SO, SHE GOES TO HER DOCTOR,
AND SHE, UM...

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.024
SHE SAYS TO HER DOCTOR,
"KISS ME."

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:00.627
- [laughs hysterically]

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.228
- NO, THAT'S NOT IT.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.131
THAT'S NOT IT.
THAT--THAT'S NOT THE PUNCH LINE.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.433
- [laughing]

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.001
YOU GOT TO STOP ALREADY.

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:10.403
YOU'RE KILLING ME OVER HERE.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.904
- OH, YOU--

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:14.173
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU THINK
THE JOKE IS OVER, BUT IT'S NOT.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:15.407
IT'S ACTUALLY JUST STARTING.

00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:19.579
- [laughing hysterically]

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.579
- OKAY.
SO I'M GONNA--

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:21.714
I'M JUST GONNA SPEED UP.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.349
SO SHE SAYS TO HER DOCTOR,
"KISS ME,"

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.918
AND HE SAYS, "I CAN'T.
IT WOULD BE UNPROFESSIONAL."

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.754
- [laughing]
- NO. NO, NOT EVEN CLOSE.

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:31.991
SHE SAYS--HE SAYS,
"THAT WOULD BE UNPROFESSIONAL,"

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.494
AND THEN SHE SAYS,
SHE KEEPS ASKING HIM,

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.861
AND HE SAYS, "NO, NO, NO."

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:38.364
HAPPENS THREE TIMES LIKE THAT.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.066
FINALLY, AT THE END, SHE SAYS,

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:43.369
"KISS ME," AND HE SAYS,

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.839
"I SHOULDN'T EVEN BE HAVING SEX
WITH YOU RIGHT NOW."

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:53.079
- THEN WHAT HAPPENS?

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.647
- [stammers]
I DON'T--I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:55.647 --> 00:01:58.751
THEN, I GUESS SHE--
SHE PROBABLY SUED HIM

00:01:58.751 --> 00:01:59.752
FOR MALPRACTICE?

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:03.722
- [laughs]

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:07.126
SUED HIM FOR MALPRACTICE.

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:09.362
[hysterical gibberish]

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:12.364
- SO YOU KNOW THAT WASN'T--
THAT WASN'T THE PUNCH LINE?

00:02:12.364 --> 00:02:13.700
- THAT WASN'T THE PUNCH LINE?

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.168
- NO. THE PUNCH--
- THERE'S MORE?

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.203
[laughing]
- NO, THERE'S NOT.

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.237
THERE'S NOT MORE.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:20.373
- THERE'S MORE TO THE JOKE?

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.975
- NO, THERE--
THERE'S ACTUALLY LESS.

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:26.879
- WELL, THAT'S IT!
YOU TURNED IT AROUND!

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.781
- NO, THERE'S--
- YOU TURNED IT AROUND!

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:31.250
- THE JOKE--
- HE SAID LESS!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.818
- THE JOKE WAS--
- THERE CAN'T BE LESS.

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:35.588
- THE PUNCH LINE WAS THE ONLY
PART THAT YOU DIDN'T LAUGH AT.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.197
- [laughs]
WHAT THE [bleep]?

00:02:45.197 --> 00:02:46.466
YOU GOT ME!
- YOU GOT ME.

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:49.101
YOU WERE DOING A JOKE
THE WHOLE TIME!

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:51.070
YOU WERE DOING A WEIRD CHARACTER
THE WHOLE TIME.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.639
- OH, MY GOD, YES.
YES.

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:56.409
I LOVE THE MALPRACTICE STUFF.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:59.545
THE MALPRACTICE PUNCH LINE
IS HILARIOUS.

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.547
- SO YOU WEREN'T DOING
A CHARACTER?

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:03.649
- WHAT CHARACT--WHAT CHARACTER?
- OKAY.

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:05.251
